  "description": "Simulates a social-ecological system with various numbers of individuals and a regrowing resource (trees). Agents are modest (green) or greedy (red) and harvest at different rates; offspring inherit their parent's type with a mutation parameter. Students observe how population and resources fluctuate based on harvest level, living costs, mutation rate, resource regrowth, and carrying capacity.",
